WEBVTT

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:11.690
I still don't know, really...

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:14.890
What exactly is my superpower?

00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:18.390
My turn!

00:01:18.740 --> 00:01:23.640
Your attacks don't work on me—

00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:32.150
Min-chan, it's dangerous!

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:32.720
Wait!

00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:33.780
Why?

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:36.150
He's the strongest boss 
in the whole universe!

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:38.450
He'll just tear you in half 
if you try! Understand?

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:41.510
I've already died once.

00:01:41.510 --> 00:01:44.450
Even if I died, I wouldn't 
give a farty-face.

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:46.160
Yamada...

00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:55.830
Holy water...?

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:02.240
It's the fake me...

00:02:02.540 --> 00:02:03.890
There is a toilet, after all!

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:06.100
Lucky me! Maybe I still can get back!

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:08.440
Nope, never mind.

00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:12.950
Underestimating one's foe is the greatest 
insult one can give to a warrior.

00:02:13.310 --> 00:02:17.110
You are the first and last 
person to humiliate me so!

00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:18.710
Show me...

00:02:18.710 --> 00:02:21.830
...your full power, Earth Hero!

00:02:24.820 --> 00:02:26.740
You would still underestimate me?

00:02:26.740 --> 00:02:28.760
You think you can fuck with me, asshole?

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:29.920
Wash...

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:35.620
My stupid son's pissing on me!

00:02:45.730 --> 00:02:49.150
I'm sick of hearing your sexy moans.

00:02:50.030 --> 00:02:51.620
Father, forgive me!

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:53.500
Don't kill me! Please!

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.410
I don't want to die yet!

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:56.530
What are you going to do?

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:58.040
I'll do anything!

00:02:58.040 --> 00:02:59.880
I'll be anyone!

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:01.070
Turn to dust!

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:08.160
Wh-What happened?

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:10.290
See? I'm strong!

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:11.290
Fight for real!

00:03:12.570 --> 00:03:14.860
<i>But do I actually even</i>

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:17.180
<i>have any superpowers?</i>

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:20.610
<i>All the enemies just died without 
me doing anything so far...</i>

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:23.290
<i>I never had superpowers,</i>

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:25.930
<i>and I was never a superhero!</i>

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:27.040
What?

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:28.340
Can you say that in the dialogue font,

00:03:28.340 --> 00:03:30.520
not the monologue font? Dialogue!

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:34.270
I'm no hero...

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:36.150
You're the hero of this world!

00:03:37.770 --> 00:03:39.900
You're the only one who can beat him!

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:41.950
Min-chan, no!

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:43.910
Get away from here!

00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:46.040
Good to see she's a lively one!

00:03:48.090 --> 00:03:49.500
No!

00:03:55.940 --> 00:03:56.750
Yamada-san!

00:03:57.720 --> 00:03:59.460
Who's Yamada?

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:15.890
That was so cool, Yamada-san! 
You're stronger than me!

00:04:15.890 --> 00:04:18.320
Is it the power of the meat he ate?! Damn!

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:21.110
I'm super-macho, thanks to my honey!

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:22.950
They say to never let your guard 
down, and never shave your balls!

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:23.520
See?

00:04:23.520 --> 00:04:25.660
Who the hell is Yamada, anyway?

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:31.370
I've seen through your tricks, Yamada—

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:32.810
It stinks!

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:34.420
You're in the way, Yamada-

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:36.610
From behind, too? Goddamn it!

00:04:36.610 --> 00:04:37.560
Are they your helper?

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:41.100
And what is this indescribable scent?

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:43.380
Father, do what you will with the Earth,

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:46.680
but I won't let you hurt Min-chan!

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:54.770
Min-chan, I'll protect you 
if it costs me my life!

00:04:55.380 --> 00:04:57.970
Is that golden stuff what I think it is?

00:04:58.270 --> 00:04:59.190
Don't say it...

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:02.000
You would throw aside your 
claim to the throne,

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.810
and fight me for the sake of that girl?

00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:04.990
Are you serious?

00:05:05.220 --> 00:05:06.400
Fate! Fate!

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:07.990
This is all fate!

00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:11.200
I've had enough of your shit, 
in more ways than one!

00:05:12.070 --> 00:05:14.540
Shi! Ri! Metsu! Retsu!

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:17.070
Kan! Zen! Mu! Ketsu!

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:21.340
Great King Kick!

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:25.960
No need for love!

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:27.050
No need for pity!

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:29.020
Crush! Destroy!

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:29.680
Death!

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:31.030
Death! Death!

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.190
Yamada!

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:38.730
Mister Yamada!

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:42.030
Please, save Yamada-san!

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:47.740
Now then, Yamada...

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:50.410
By the way, who are you?

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:54.180
No! No! No!

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:00.330
Time for you to die!

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:08.370
Why?

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:13.350
Is it all my fault?

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:14.930
I see.

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:16.980
He was a dataling?

00:06:17.490 --> 00:06:20.970
Earthlings, what did you do to him?

00:06:20.970 --> 00:06:22.430
Why does he not fear?

00:06:22.430 --> 00:06:24.120
Why does he fight?

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:28.020
I possess the most information 
in the universe,

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:30.450
and Earthlings are the one 
thing I don't understand.

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:32.890
My son...

00:06:32.890 --> 00:06:36.040
Are you going to leave me, too?

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:37.700
I'm done.

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:40.920
I'm going to Hell and taking 
this place with me.

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:42.940
W-Wait, Yamada-san,

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:44.180
don't be hasty!

00:06:44.180 --> 00:06:45.650
Who cares?

00:06:45.650 --> 00:06:48.210
Worst he'll get from jumping at 
this height is some broken bones.

00:06:48.210 --> 00:06:49.980
And once he can't move he won't be

00:06:49.980 --> 00:06:52.590
able to enjoy the happiness 
that waits for him.

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:53.450
Shaddup!

00:06:53.450 --> 00:06:55.350
What kind of happiness is

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:57.680
there for a guy like me?

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:59.410
Hell if I know,

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:02.010
but as long as you're alive, 
anything can happen, right?

00:07:02.010 --> 00:07:04.440
That's what makes it fun, right?

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:07.690
Oh, I found this out-of-print issue 
of Teen Girls in School Swimsuits.

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:13.200
<b>Teen Girls in School Swimsuits</b>

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:09.900
<b>Details Here!</b>

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:09.510
You want?

00:07:09.510 --> 00:07:10.400
Stupid dad!

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:13.200
Are you trying to save him or kill him?

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:16.680
I found scenes like this in 
their memory information.

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:20.190
The logical circuitry they're using 
is completely foreign to me.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:24.290
But they're always emitting warm signals,

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:26.430
bringing me peace,

00:07:26.430 --> 00:07:28.770
and driving me wild!

00:07:30.990 --> 00:07:33.980
Then I shall release you from that dream!

00:07:36.570 --> 00:07:39.890
Stop it! Stop!

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:43.560
Farewell... Ya...mada...

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:52.380
Wait! Don't go!

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:57.410
Mister Yamada!

00:07:57.640 --> 00:07:59.870
Give the two of them back!

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:02.080
Do you want to die, too?

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:03.080
Yamada-san!

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:08.300
I don't want to lose anyone else...

00:08:14.770 --> 00:08:16.310
Mister Yamada...

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:19.280
You're going to beat me, right?

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:23.070
All this chaos is my fault.

00:08:23.070 --> 00:08:25.440
If my dying will fix it all,

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:26.690
kill me!

00:08:27.140 --> 00:08:30.660
So the brave hero of Earth

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:32.860
falls to his knees and begs to surrender?

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:35.880
I told you, I'm no hero,

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:37.650
and I have no superpowers.

00:08:37.650 --> 00:08:39.710
I was imagining the whole thing.

00:08:40.010 --> 00:08:43.340
All your men died because of me.

00:08:43.340 --> 00:08:45.620
If you want revenge, take it out on me.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:47.950
Very well.

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:50.820
Yell "I am a loser.

00:08:50.820 --> 00:08:53.050
Please let me die." three times.

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:56.580
Then I shall kill you and leave this planet.

00:08:56.580 --> 00:08:59.460
I swear on my name as king.

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:02.240
Keep your promise.

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:11.230
<b>11th Day as a Hero:</b>

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:06.520
I am a loser. Please let me die.

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:11.230
<b>"I am a loser. Please let me die."</b>

00:09:06.820 --> 00:09:07.630
No!

00:09:08.170 --> 00:09:11.230
No, don't say that!

00:09:12.020 --> 00:09:13.320
You're a hero!

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.110
You're the only one who can save the world!

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:17.900
I'm a loser! Please let me die!

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:20.710
If you die, the world will really end!

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:22.860
You're the one who told me the story

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:24.830
about the hero beating the evil King!

00:09:25.090 --> 00:09:26.330
Did you forget all that?

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:28.160
Wake up!

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:29.890
Wake up!

00:09:29.890 --> 00:09:31.710
Father, stop!

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:34.130
Shut up, woman!

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:36.630
Shut up and die!
